      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have the same phenomenon.\n\nAt least it has never happened before in other worlds and it happens in the relevant world.\n\n- Desktop mode\n\n  - Interacting in VR mode works fine.\n\n- The resolution in window mode is less than 1600x900\n\n  - (When the resolution is increased, the interactivity is normal from that moment on.\n\n  - Display resolution is 2560x1440\n\n- I cannot interact with the mouse while pressing the Tab key (free mouse mode).\n\nAccording to what I have heard, it seems that the position of the mouse cursor and the actual raycast are misaligned.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
